body:
It can be fixed by this patch. 

```
.markup .task-list-item {
    list-style-type: none;
    position: relative; /* add this */
}
.markup .task-list-item input[type=checkbox] {
   /* before:  margin: 0 6px 0.25em -1.6em;
      replace with below:
  */
    position: absolute;
    top: 0.25em;
    left: -1.6em;
}
```


